# RemarketAI Environment Variables

# ===================================
# EMAIL SENDING - Choose ONE option below
# ===================================

# OPTION 1: Resend (RECOMMENDED for SaaS)
# ✅ Best deliverability (95-99%)
# ✅ Free tier: 3,000 emails/month
# ✅ Professional email infrastructure
# Get yours at: https://resend.com/api-keys
RESEND_API_KEY=re_123456789
FROM_EMAIL=noreply@yourdomain.com

# OPTION 2: Gmail (Easy setup, good for testing)
# ✅ Free: 500 emails/day
# ⚠️  Lower deliverability for marketing emails (70-85%)
# ⚠️  Requires App Password (not regular password)
# Setup guide: https://support.google.com/accounts/answer/185833
# GMAIL_USER=your-email@gmail.com
# GMAIL_APP_PASSWORD=your-16-char-app-password

# OPTION 3: Custom SMTP (For users with own mail servers)
# ✅ Full control, send from your domain
# ✅ Works with Google Workspace, Microsoft 365, any SMTP server
# ⚠️  Requires proper DNS setup (SPF, DKIM, DMARC)
# SMTP_HOST=smtp.gmail.com
# SMTP_PORT=587
# SMTP_SECURE=false
# SMTP_USER=your-email@yourdomain.com
# SMTP_PASSWORD=your-password
# FROM_EMAIL=noreply@yourdomain.com

# ===================================
# COMMON SMTP SETTINGS BY PROVIDER
# ===================================

# Google Workspace / Gmail:
# SMTP_HOST=smtp.gmail.com
# SMTP_PORT=587
# SMTP_SECURE=false

# Microsoft 365 / Outlook:
# SMTP_HOST=smtp.office365.com
# SMTP_PORT=587
# SMTP_SECURE=false

# SendGrid (via SMTP):
# SMTP_HOST=smtp.sendgrid.net
# SMTP_PORT=587
# SMTP_USER=apikey
# SMTP_PASSWORD=your-sendgrid-api-key

# AWS SES:
# SMTP_HOST=email-smtp.us-east-1.amazonaws.com
# SMTP_PORT=587
# SMTP_USER=your-ses-smtp-username
# SMTP_PASSWORD=your-ses-smtp-password

# ===================================
# VISITOR IDENTIFICATION (Optional but powerful!)
# ===================================

# People Data Labs - RECOMMENDED! Best pricing & data quality
# ✅ Identifies person + company from IP
# ✅ More affordable than Clearbit
# ✅ Better coverage (1.5B+ person records)
# 💰 Pay-as-you-go: $0.03 per successful match
# 💰 Free trial: 1,000 credits
# Get key at: https://www.peopledatalabs.com/
# PDL_API_KEY=...

# Clearbit Reveal - Alternative (more expensive)
# ✅ Good for B2B - identifies company from IP address
# 💰 Free tier: 500 lookups/month (then $99+/mo)
# Get key at: https://clearbit.com/
# CLEARBIT_API_KEY=sk_...

# FullContact - Email enrichment
# ✅ Enriches known emails with social profiles, company data
# 💰 Paid service
# Get key at: https://www.fullcontact.com/
# FULLCONTACT_API_KEY=...

# IPinfo - IP geolocation and company lookup
# ✅ Good for identifying companies by IP
# 💰 Free tier: 50,000 requests/month
# Get key at: https://ipinfo.io/
# IPINFO_API_KEY=...

# ===================================
# OPTIONAL: AI EMAIL GENERATION
# ===================================

# For production, use real AI (Claude or OpenAI)
# Get Claude API key at: https://console.anthropic.com/
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=sk-ant-...

# Or use OpenAI instead
# Get OpenAI API key at: https://platform.openai.com/api-keys
OPENAI_API_KEY=sk-...

# ===================================
# NOTES
# ===================================
# - System auto-detects which email provider to use based on env vars
# - Without any email config: Emails logged to console (demo mode)
# - Best deliverability: Resend > Custom SMTP > Gmail
# - For SaaS: Let each customer configure their own email provider

# VISITOR IDENTIFICATION METHODS:
# 1. Automatic (No API needed):
#    - Browser fingerprinting
#    - UTM parameter tracking
#    - Email link tracking
#    - Referrer analysis
#
# 2. With API keys (More powerful):
#    - Clearbit: Identify company from IP (B2B)
#    - IPinfo: IP to company lookup
#    - FullContact: Email enrichment
#
# 3. Manual (Highest accuracy):
#    - Form submissions
#    - User clicks "identify" button
